flowchart TD
  A[Admin run or cron trigger] --> B[Auto-pipeline]
  B --> C[Fetch RSS and configured NewsAPI]
  M[Manual news entry] --> D[News items]
  F[Manual Firecrawl extraction] --> D
  C --> H[Title and URL hash - configured source score]
  H --> D
  D --> E[Recent news selection for show and city]
  E --> G[Generate original Tamil RJ script]
  G --> S{Sensitive source category?}
  S -->|Yes| P[Pending review - approval required]
  S -->|No| Q[Published episode - audio may be absent]
  P -.-> R[Admin review - approval flag clearing incomplete]
  P --> T{Skip audio?}
  Q --> T
  T -->|No| V[Sarvam voice requests]
  V --> W[Concatenate bytes and upload WAV]
  W --> X[Save episode audio URL]
  T -->|Yes| Y[Script-only episode]
  X --> L[Listener sees permitted published episodes]
  Y --> L
  L --> Z{Audio URL exists?}
  Z -->|Yes| AA[Browser audio playback]
  Z -->|No| AB[Mock progress - silent]
